.DS_Store

# Working notes live in _notes/, a symlink to the private working-notes repo.
# No trailing slash: git treats a symlink as a file, so `_notes/` would not
# match it.
#
# NOTE: a blanket `*.md` used to sit above this, which incidentally served as
# the filename-pattern backstop DESIGN.md prescribes (NEXT_STEPS.md,
# *_handoff.md, ...). It was removed 2026-07-21 so tracked specs can live in
# the repo again — so that backstop is now ABSENT. A working note written
# beside the source instead of into _notes/ will no longer be ignored.
_notes
